  nonce: '0309'  # 0309
  message: "That's not why we had those 50 wasted stop attempts. it was because the writes to the guidance folder were changing the hash, and that issue has been fixed. doing this would prevent important analyses that might not be code changes therefore we won't do it."  # 0309
